// cp Secrets.example.xcconfig Secrets.xcconfig, then fill this in. Secrets.xcconfig is gitignored.
//
// This branch (muse) runs on Meta's Model API, dev.meta.ai: one key covers both.
//   MUSE_API_KEY   — speech-to-text, Muse Voice Transcribe (realtime websocket)
//   ANSWER_*       — the answer model. muse = Muse Spark; groq / cerebras / openai also work.
//   ANSWER_MODEL   — optional override, e.g. muse-spark-1.3 (default for muse is muse-spark-1.1)
MUSE_API_KEY =
ANSWER_PROVIDER = muse
ANSWER_API_KEY =
ANSWER_MODEL =
